# The engine comes from node's release tarball rather than the upstream v8
# archive for the same reasons as v8-9.4, v8-12.4 and v8-13.6: node-26 ships
# this exact V8 with its own floating patches, and that patched tree is what
# the ppc-darwin series below was derived against; and node vendors every V8
# DEPS checkout the CMake build needs (abseil-cpp complete with its own
# CMakeLists, third_party/glibc ieee754 math, fp16, fast_float, dragonbox,
# rapidhash-v8, jinja2, markupsafe, zlib, inspector_protocol, trace_event;
# simdutf and highway too, although this port links the system ones - see
# below). node-v26.13.0/deps/v8 IS the port's v8/ tree. Node's own Rust
# dependency (deps/crates, for V8's Temporal) is not needed: Temporal is off
# in this build.

# No googletest distfile: as at 12.4/13.6 the harness excludes
# crdtp/status_test_support.cc, so node's googletest copy - pruned to
# gtest_prod.h - is sufficient.

# NOTE: node 26 receives maintenance releases until 2029-04. The engine
# stays 14.6.202.x, but on a distfile bump re-verify that the series still
# applies without fuzz (upstream floats patches into deps/v8).
set node_version        26.13.0

